---
source: tests/moonshot/fixtures.rs
expression: messages
---
- role: User
  parts:
    - Text: What is the weather in Beijing?
- role: Assistant
  parts:
    - Reasoning: "The user is asking for the weather in Beijing. I need to use the get_weather function to get this information. Let me check the function parameters:\n\n- location: string (City name) - This is required\n\nBeijing is the location, so I'll pass that to the function."
    - ToolCall:
        id: "get_weather:0"
        name: get_weather
        arguments:
          location: Beijing
- role: Tool
  parts:
    - Text: "{\"temperature\":\"25°C\",\"condition\":\"Sunny\",\"location\":\"Beijing\"}"
    - ToolResult:
        call_id: "get_weather:0"
        content:
          condition: Sunny
          location: Beijing
          temperature: 25°C
        is_error: false
